= Preparing an Economic Programme

Our economic programme must address inflation, employment, production and dependence on foreign currency. Before we can govern, we need to organize support for reform.

- @prepare: Prepare proposals and explain them to our supporters.
- @root: Return to party affairs.

@prepare
on-arrival: crisis_urgency += 1; workers_chp += 2*(1-dissent); state_employees_chp += 2*(1-dissent)

We prepare proposals for the ministries responsible for economic policy. When we hold those ministries, we can implement the programme through Government Affairs.
